{"title":"Cobalt","slug":"Cobalt","hero":{"file":"Cobalt_Oaklands.webp","width":213,"height":219},"pageid":775,"revid":20548,"timestamp":"2025-11-25T23:47:44Z","lastEditor":"Quantumwalker","categories":["Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Ore","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$22/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$30/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.4.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/03/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p>Cobalt has a light-yellow gray hue, mostly found on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater_Island/\">Ferwater Island</a> in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Limestone/\">Limestone</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Chalkyslate/\">Chalkyslate</a>, and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blueslate/\">Blueslate</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Limestone/\">Limestone</a> \nis one of the two surface ores in the Oke desert making that the most reliable way of finding cobalt.\n</p>"}
